<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE, Australia 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scores on the first</p>
<p>day of four-day Sheffield Shield matches on Friday:</p>
<p>In Adelaide: New South Wales 282 for five (Corey Richards</p>
<p>76) v South Australia.</p>
<p>In Perth: Victoria 322 for nine (Rohan Larkin 104, Ian</p>
<p>Harvey 55) v Western Australia</p>
</text>
